Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Components of the Riemann tensor in terms of the components of the curvature \
spinors\
\>", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"49d0e3e8-8424-4074-8409-b8134c1e8b6b"],

Cell["\<\
We are going to write the components of the Riemann tensor in the null tetrad \
in terms of the spinor curvature components expressed in the spin dyad.  \
First we compute folded rules containing the independent components of each \
of the quantities involved. \
\>", "MathCaption",ExpressionUUID->"f1b055ac-bf32-4c0f-82d6-dd77a14804cb"],

