Cell["\<\
We also need to teach GHPWeightOf how to behave when acting on differential \
expressions.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 TextJustification->1.,ExpressionUUID->"9f3afe45-98ce-44bb-a487-4edd974fa8e7"],

